  "_comment": "Ore variants: every ore in every host stone (block eternalreturn:<host>_<ore>_ore). The game reads this at startup to register the blocks; tools/ores/build_ores.py reads it to write their models, textures, loot tables, recipes and tags. Adding an ore or a host is one entry here plus a rerun of the script. An ore copies its vanilla block's behaviour; its overlay is the shared pattern in tools/ores/pattern.txt coloured with its palette (h highlight, l light, m mid, d dark). A host gives the block it replaces and its textures per face (all, or top/bottom/side).",
